{{zh-ref|Schuessler (2007)}} suggests that it may be related to {{cog|km|រង||to support from below}}, {{cog|omx|tr=joṅ|t=couch; bedstead}}. Compare also {{cog|my|စင်|t=platform, stage}} ({{zh-ref|Luce, 1981}}).

{{zh-ref|Baxter & Sagart (2014)}} reconstructs OC prefixal *''k-'' based on Vietic evidences: cf. {{cog|pkt|-}} [Brô] ''kacɨəŋ'', {{cog|pkt|-}} [Kha Pong] ''kəcɨːŋ²'' , {{cog|scb|-}} [Sách, Rục] ''kəcɨːŋ²''.

